1
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,160
if anyone here needs help with anything...

2
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,480
I'm more than happy to give my full support.

3
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,960
Regarding the issue that occurred,

4
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:12,760
our company has officially removed Jet from the group.

5
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,280
The agency finds it necessary

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,880
to file a lawsuit against Jet

7
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,200
for the amount of ten million baht.

8
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:21,040
I'll buy this house, along with the pharmacy,

9
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,560
for the price of ten million baht.

10
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,200
However, you and your family

11
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,680
can still live in this house.

12
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,960
You've already helped us more than enough, P'Jane.

13
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:30,120
Is this all we have left now?

14
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,040
Give it time, we'll get used to it.

15
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,000
When we were young,

16
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,800
we went through much tougher times than this.

17
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:35,720
If we fight through this one more time,

18
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,360
we'll be just fine.

19
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:38,880
I don't understand.

20
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,880
The person I love refuses my help.

21
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,680
Because I love you,

22
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,360
that's why I have to prove

23
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:47,000
that I am worthy of being your lover,

24
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,200
Please give me some time, P'Jane.

25
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:16,880
P'Dan.

26
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,039
Jane, are you heading home?

27
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:21,680
Let me give you a ride.

28
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,880
I was planning to call a ride home myself.

29
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,479
What are you doing here again, Dan?

30
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,080
P'Jane.

31
00:01:38,479 --> 00:01:40,160
I'm here to take Jane home.

32
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:42,560
I can take care of my own lover.

33
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,200
There's no need to bother you.

34
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:47,479
Take care of him?

35
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,840
With Jane's family ending up like that,

36
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,640
isn't it all because of you?

37
00:01:59,479 --> 00:02:01,120
Can you both please calm down first?

38
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:03,800
And what about you?

39
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,000
What can you even do?

40
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:10,720
Have you ever actually been able to help anyone?

41
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,400
Jane! Hey!

42
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:16,560
Stop!

43
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,880
Stop it, both of you!

44
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:23,200
I already have enough of a headache

45
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:24,720
with what's going on at home.

46
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:26,160
You walk in with a warning sign

47
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:33,480
Just one look and already falling for you

48
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:40,920
My friends tell me not to cross that line

49
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:48,040
But I’m already out of time

50
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:52,280
I know the truth, I taste the sin

51
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,920
It’s wrong but I don’t want it to be true

52
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:56,440
I’m losing all my discipline

53
00:03:56,440 --> 00:04:00,600
You’re all I’m thinking of

54
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,600
and I’m breaking all the rules

55
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,880
just because…

56
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:08,240
You’re a red flag but I’m colorblind

57
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:11,760
I know you’re dangerous

58
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:15,360
If it burns, let it burn me alive

59
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:20,160
I can't hold myself back, I’d cross every line

60
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,360
Ooh

61
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:51,200
Please? Mom? Dad?

62
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:53,480
I've really thought this through.

63
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,400
Hey.

64
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,440
No way.

65
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,880
You can't do this.

66
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:06,200
I want you to think it over again.

67
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,000
What are you talking about?

68
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:14,680
It's Jet.

69
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:18,200
He says he wants to drop out of university to go work.

70
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,680
I've been thinking about it for a while now.

71
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:25,440
I have to do something.

72
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,520
I want to take responsibility for what I did.

73
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:43,400
I think

74
00:05:45,159 --> 00:05:47,280
we should let him do it.

75
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:52,120
But I think...

76
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,000
I trust Jet.

77
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:57,520
I think he has really thought it through this time.

78
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,920
Everything is my fault.

79
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,880
I ruined everything.

80
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:12,480
P'Jane gave me a chance,

81
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,640
but I couldn't hold onto it.

82
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:21,120
And I still made everyone suffer like this.

83
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,520
Everyone, stop blaming yourselves.

84
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:34,720
Yeah.

85
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:43,680
Jean,

86
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:48,000
I want to sell something.

87
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,920
Can you help me?

88
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,720
Are you sure?

89
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,400
And...

90
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:57,120
what are you going to sell?

91
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,400
Do you remember that marketing report

92
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:09,480
that you told me about?

93
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:10,600
The one...

94
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:13,400
You did with P'Jane back in university?

95
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,560
Chinese herbal sachet?

96
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:20,200
Could it be...

97
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:21,800
I get it now.

98
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,960
Right?

99
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:24,080
Okay.

100
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:25,560
Let's give it a shot.

101
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,159
Hello, everyone.

102
00:07:44,159 --> 00:07:45,520
Hello!

103
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:47,400
Hello to everyone on the live stream.

104
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:49,920
Today, we from Thanapat Piboonosot

105
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:52,120
are here to launch a new product,

106
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,200
and that is...

107
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:54,960
Chinese herbal sachets!

108
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,159
Here!

109
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,480
Today, we're going to open one up and show you

110
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:00,320
what kind of herbs are inside.

111
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,040
The first one

112
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:02,280
and it is

113
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,240
cinnamon!

114
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,880
Which can help

115
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,040
it's cinnamon

116
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,360
relieve dizziness

117
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,760
and nasal congestion.

118
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,200
Next, let's look at the second one.

119
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:12,200
That would be

120
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:13,440
Yaqian,

121
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:15,200
or white ginseng!

122
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:19,560
The benefits of Yaqian are...

123
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,600
What are they again, dad?

124
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,880
Help him out.

125
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:25,080
It helps nourish the brain,

126
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,600
keeps you refreshed, and improves memory too.

127
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,760
When you consume it,

128
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,720
you slice it thinly

129
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,960
and hold one or two slices in your mouth.

130
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,799
Or you can steep four or five slices in hot water

131
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,600
and sip it like tea.

132
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,320
Just like that, everyone!

133
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,640
And that's not all!

134
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:43,960
There are over ten more herbs inside!

135
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,520
But our shop will keep them a secret

136
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:46,160
for now because...

137
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,280
it's top secret!

138
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:48,160
Inside the pouch,

139
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:49,880
there are various kinds of herbs,

140
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:52,240
and we put them into cute little sachets

141
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,440
like this!

142
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,600
It will help you

143
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,640
relax more, sleep better,

144
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:58,960
repel insects, and refresh the air too!

145
00:08:58,960 --> 00:08:59,600
Miss A?

146
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,480
Miss A, two sachets.

147
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,000
Miss A, two sachets.

148
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,240
Order received!

149
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:05,280
Thank you!

150
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:06,520
Thank you!

151
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:09,720
Miss Mo, three sachets!

152
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,800
Miss Mo, three sachets, order received!

153
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,520
Thank you!

154
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:14,960
Mr.Pat bought all ten sachets!

155
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,600
Thank you!

156
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,400
Thank you! Order received!

157
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,680
So many people are buying!

158
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,200
Dad! We've been standing here selling for so long!

159
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,800
Yeah. They can hear you on the live.

160
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:24,600
Oh!

161
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,880
Thank you!

162
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:35,880
Jane, Jean, Jet,

163
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:36,920
you must be tired from live streaming.

164
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,240
Have some cold water.

165
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,800
Thanks mom.

166
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:41,400
Sure.

167
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:42,680
Thank you.

168
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,320
I never thought

169
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,480
a quick live stream would bring in so many sales.

170
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,280
You did great.

171
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:55,760
Mm.

172
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,680
I'm surprised too.

173
00:09:58,880 --> 00:09:59,720
We really need to hurry

174
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,000
and help each other pack everything.

175
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,120
Making this much money,

176
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,440
no matter how many boxes I have to pack,

177
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:05,480
I can handle it!

178
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,640
It's just as you said,

179
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:13,000
wellness trends are really popular right now

180
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:16,080
so people really want to buy this.

181
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,240
We really have to thank the idea

182
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:20,000
you came up with back then.

183
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:22,640
Not at all,

184
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:26,800
it happened because everyone helped out.

185
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:31,920
Let me go prepare some food so we can all eat.

186
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,000
I'll help too!

187
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,400
Finish this part for me, please.

188
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:35,960
Okay.

189
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:38,200
Come on.

190
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,080
Put it here.

191
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:48,320
All done.

192
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:38,200
Is something wrong, Jet?

193
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:41,040
What are you standing here thinking about?

194
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,440
Sorry.

195
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,800
I was just standing here letting my mind wander.

196
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:48,680
Was today very exhausting?

197
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,920
It was exhausting,

198
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:55,000
but I'm happy we sold well.

199
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,800
Thank you...

200
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:00,080
for..

201
00:12:00,520 --> 00:12:01,800
for helping invest in the first batch

202
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:04,080
so we could buy the herbs to sell.

203
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,360
But looking at your face,

204
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:11,360
it seems like things over on your end

205
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,600
are much more exhausting.

206
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,440
Did you fight with P'Jane?

207
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,000
We didn't fight.

208
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:30,720
But things aren't the same, right?

209
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:37,440
Everything started when I caused trouble, didn't it?

210
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,640
Jet...

211
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:41,920
I know.

212
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,560
If I wasn't around,

213
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:51,400
you might have been able to follow your dream

214
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:53,240
of becoming a comic artist.

215
00:12:58,080 --> 00:13:00,080
That had nothing to do with you at all.

216
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:03,680
I made my own choice.

217
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,320
I thought it was the best option.

218
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:09,080
In the end,

219
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:12,920
I'm still the same kid who never grew up.

220
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:21,000
I'm sorry.

221
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,360
Come on, now.

222
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:27,600
It's okay.

223
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:31,240
I'm just so..

224
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:33,400
I feel so sorry for you.

225
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,280
You don't have to carry everyone else's feelings

226
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:38,720
that much.

227
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:43,480
Do something for yourself for once.

228
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:57,080
I'm not that great of a person either, Jet.

229
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:01,280
When you became an idol,

230
00:14:03,760 --> 00:14:05,640
I was so happy for you.

231
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,040
But deep down...

232
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,680
I was jealous

233
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:16,880
that you got to follow your dream.

234
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:22,560
I'm sorry, Jet.

235
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:25,760
Hey..

236
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:29,600
Even though I got to pursue my dream,

237
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:32,600
I couldn't keep it anyway.

238
00:14:49,760 --> 00:14:51,080
And about P'Jane...

239
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,200
Do you really think it's good

240
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:55,280
for things to be like this?

241
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:56,800
I don't know.

242
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:01,760
I don't know

243
00:15:01,760 --> 00:15:03,560
if I'm even suitable for P'Jane.

244
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,400
But I can tell, you know,

245
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,080
that you two love each other very much.

246
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:11,080
P'Jane...

247
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:14,360
he was ready to help you

248
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,520
when you were in trouble.

249
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,360
But I don't want other people to

250
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:20,080
view it as me dating P'Jane for benefits.

251
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:22,600
And do you think

252
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:25,920
that doing this...

253
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:29,000
will actually make P'Jane happy?

254
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,960
Can you handle the live stream with Jean?

255
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:40,320
I'm going out to take care of an important matter.

256
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:48,360
You can go ahead and eat first.

257
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,200
I'll hurry back.

258
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:05,960
Tee, two more sachets!

259
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:06,800
Got it!

260
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:08,000
Order received!

261
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:09,640
Hey!

262
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:11,040
Pat ordered ten sachets!

263
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,400
Pat, ten sachets in total!

264
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,400
Mr.Jane,

265
00:16:17,400 --> 00:16:19,000
someone is here asking to see you.

266
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:21,040
Send them in.

267
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,680
Thank you, P'Jane,

268
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:43,680
for letting me see you.

269
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,080
Get to the point.

270
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,800
What do you want coming to see me today?

271
00:16:57,400 --> 00:16:59,680
Or do you still want to ask for a favor?

272
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:01,560
Haven't you learned your lesson?

273
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,280
I've learned my lesson.

274
00:17:04,599 --> 00:17:06,000
I won't do it anymore.

275
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:13,640
I want to thank you again, P'Jane,

276
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:16,000
for always helping me out.

277
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:17,560
And...

278
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:19,480
I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

279
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:22,520
But today...

280
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:27,800
I came to tell you, P'Jane, that...

281
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:32,240
I have a new dream now.

282
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:35,440
Your dream of becoming an idol

283
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:37,040
didn't get anywhere yet.

284
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:40,920
Now you want to change it again?

285
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:49,080
My dream right now is to...

286
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,760
earn ten million baht

287
00:17:52,760 --> 00:17:55,280
to buy my family house back from you.

288
00:18:01,600 --> 00:18:04,520
My only request for today is...

289
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:08,320
when that time comes,

290
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:13,000
please sell the house back to me.

291
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:23,320
How can I be sure that you can actually do it?

292
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,000
Right now, our sales...

293
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,720
have really increased a lot.

294
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:31,840
It is high right now, true,

295
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:35,000
but what will you do

296
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:37,680
if one day this method stops working,

297
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:40,000
sales drop, and you can't sell anything?

298
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:43,240
I'll find other ways until I can sell.

299
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:45,880
I will never give up

300
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:48,360
until my parents can live comfortably.

301
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,200
And most importantly...

302
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:53,000
I don't want my brother

303
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:55,000
to carry every burden alone anymore.

304
00:18:57,600 --> 00:19:00,440
It's time for me to take over from him.

305
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:04,280
So that he can finally live his own life.

306
00:19:08,360 --> 00:19:10,200
I'll wait until that day then.

307
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,400
Besides,

308
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,880
I didn't really want your family's house.

309
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,680
But if I didn't do that,

310
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,880
Jane wouldn't let me help.

311
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:37,680
And...

312
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:43,400
P'Jane, please don't be angry with my brother.

313
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:46,400
He means really well for you,

314
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:49,280
maybe even a bit too much.

315
00:19:54,080 --> 00:19:57,280
Please try to understand him a bit, P'Jane.

316
00:20:01,280 --> 00:20:03,000
I think you should go home.

317
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:05,880
I have work to finish.

318
00:20:41,600 --> 00:20:43,280
Jet came to see me yesterday.

319
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:48,080
He already told me everything.

320
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:51,040
Are you still sulking?

321
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:55,080
I'm not sulking.

322
00:20:59,280 --> 00:21:00,440
I don't believe you.

323
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:02,880
You are definitely sulking.

324
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:08,280
Whatever you say, Mr.CEO man.

325
00:21:09,360 --> 00:21:11,600
What right does a secretary like me have to argue?

326
00:21:16,040 --> 00:21:16,720
This morning,

327
00:21:16,720 --> 00:21:17,600
there's a project pitch regarding

328
00:21:17,600 --> 00:21:18,880
a payment platform.

329
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:20,480
I've already put the appointment

330
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:21,520
in your email calendar.

331
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:36,800
Regarding the startup today,

332
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:39,440
I might need to bother you for your input.

333
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:41,840
Me?

334
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,280
Mm.

335
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:49,560
Our platform serves as

336
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:51,360
an agent to receive work

337
00:21:51,360 --> 00:21:53,640
and manage payments for Thai artists

338
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:56,200
who want to accept commissions from overseas clients.

339
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:59,400
Having been close to the artist community,

340
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:01,120
we understand the pain points artists face

341
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:03,720
when receiving international payment transfers.

342
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:06,000
From expensive transaction fees

343
00:22:06,040 --> 00:22:08,000
to headaches regarding taxes.

344
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:09,560
So we want to step in and help

345
00:22:09,560 --> 00:22:11,400
fellow artists with this issue.

346
00:22:12,040 --> 00:22:13,280
Jennalee?

347
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,840
May I have your opinion on this?

348
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:07,960
(Dan: Where are you, Jane?)

349
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:10,720
(Jane: Heading home soon.)

350
00:23:10,720 --> 00:23:13,520
(Dan: It's late, want me to pick you up?)

351
00:23:29,360 --> 00:23:31,520
Where does the platform's main revenue come from?

352
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:34,200
It comes from per-order transaction fees,

353
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:36,520
a 1 to 3 percent deduction per transaction.

354
00:23:36,520 --> 00:23:39,840
We set it at that rate to attract users,

355
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:41,120
and because we see how much

356
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:42,480
our fellow artists struggle,

357
00:23:42,520 --> 00:23:44,400
we chose to cap it at 3 percent.

358
00:23:57,920 --> 00:24:00,560
I really commend the team for your effort,

359
00:24:05,040 --> 00:24:06,080
but I'd like the team to go back,

360
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:07,280
conduct more research,

361
00:24:07,320 --> 00:24:09,080
and adjust the business model

362
00:24:10,120 --> 00:24:11,960
before presenting it again.

363
00:24:13,720 --> 00:24:14,640
Uh...

364
00:24:14,640 --> 00:24:16,040
that means?

365
00:24:16,040 --> 00:24:17,920
I agree with Jennalee.

366
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:21,720
We'll have to pass on this proposal for now.

367
00:24:45,120 --> 00:24:46,680
Jennalee?

368
00:24:47,520 --> 00:24:48,840
Uh, well...

369
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:52,080
I'm sorry

370
00:24:52,800 --> 00:24:54,200
for giving that opinion earlier.

371
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:56,120
Because of that, your project...

372
00:24:56,280 --> 00:24:57,120
Um, it's alright,

373
00:24:57,120 --> 00:24:58,080
I understand.

374
00:24:58,600 --> 00:24:59,800
Reason I called you wasn't about that,

375
00:24:59,800 --> 00:25:01,160
it's just that

376
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:02,760
I happened to catch a glimpse

377
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:04,480
of your phone screen.

378
00:25:05,360 --> 00:25:08,080
I recognized it as artwork by an artist I follow,

379
00:25:08,560 --> 00:25:10,640
though they haven't posted any work in five years.

380
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:15,680
Besides,

381
00:25:16,080 --> 00:25:17,480
you're the first person

382
00:25:17,840 --> 00:25:20,040
I've seen who follows this artist too.

383
00:25:21,440 --> 00:25:22,400
Do you happen to know any news

384
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:23,800
about where they went?

385
00:25:25,920 --> 00:25:27,080
I'm sorry,

386
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:28,400
Please excuse me.

387
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:29,240
Uh...

388
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:30,480
Huh?

389
00:25:39,280 --> 00:25:40,400
Jane?

390
00:25:52,600 --> 00:25:53,960
Are you okay?

391
00:25:58,840 --> 00:26:00,080
You don't look so good.

392
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:09,960
You did great.

393
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:31,480
I feel like I just destroyed someone else's dream...

394
00:26:33,120 --> 00:26:35,480
just like how I destroyed my own.

395
00:26:40,800 --> 00:26:41,680
If not being an emotional person

396
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:43,280
means feeling like this,

397
00:26:48,600 --> 00:26:50,880
I'd rather stay emotional.

398
00:27:01,320 --> 00:27:03,200
I don't know what to tell you.

399
00:27:05,280 --> 00:27:06,640
There, there...

400
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:12,400
Hey, let's go meet up with friends.

401
00:27:13,080 --> 00:27:14,400
Wanna grab a drink?

402
00:27:14,600 --> 00:27:15,440
Same old place.

403
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,720
I'll ask my friend who owns the place

404
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:18,480
to give us a discount.

405
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:31,440
P'Jane must be doing this to mess with me.

406
00:27:31,960 --> 00:27:32,880
That's why he asked for my opinion

407
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:34,600
right in the middle of the meeting like that.

408
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:36,720
Huh.

409
00:27:37,720 --> 00:27:40,040
Seeing that I don't know how to reject people,

410
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:43,200
he deliberately tried to mess with me!

411
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:45,280
You're talking nonsense now.

412
00:27:45,280 --> 00:27:47,000
Who would overthink things to that extent?

413
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:47,680
Yeah,

414
00:27:47,680 --> 00:27:49,000
who knows?

415
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:50,320
But this is P'Jane?

416
00:27:50,320 --> 00:27:51,160
Hey,

417
00:27:51,160 --> 00:27:51,760
Khing,

418
00:27:51,760 --> 00:27:54,280
don't just go along with everything Jane says.

419
00:27:54,280 --> 00:27:56,640
He's drunk and taking it out on everything.

420
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:57,920
Speaking of which,

421
00:27:58,680 --> 00:28:00,200
can you even drive back like this?

422
00:28:01,280 --> 00:28:02,680
If I can't, who gives a damn?

423
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:03,200
Whoa.

424
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:04,120
I'll just sleep here.

425
00:28:04,120 --> 00:28:04,920
Come on.

426
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:06,960
Tomorrow I'll just go to work in this same outfit.

427
00:28:07,600 --> 00:28:09,320
Like hell you will!

428
00:28:09,320 --> 00:28:11,200
Call a taxi back, man.

429
00:28:11,200 --> 00:28:11,760
You can leave your car here,

430
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:12,960
I'll let the owner know.

431
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,400
Ugh, no!!

432
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:15,400
Damn.

433
00:28:15,720 --> 00:28:17,000
There you go being stubborn again.

434
00:28:18,760 --> 00:28:20,080
Hello, everyone!

435
00:28:20,840 --> 00:28:23,200
Welcome to all our guests tonight.

436
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:25,200
Tonight, our bar

437
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:27,800
will have a very special show.

438
00:28:27,800 --> 00:28:30,160
And the person coming out to perform tonight...

439
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:31,400
he said

440
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:32,880
it's a surprise for his boyfriend!

441
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,800
For his boyfriend!

442
00:28:34,800 --> 00:28:36,200
Please enjoy the show!

443
00:28:41,160 --> 00:28:42,200
Hey!

444
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:43,960
Isn't that P'Big Jane?

445
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:44,800
Huh?

446
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:30,800
Woo! That's my boss!

447
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:32,320
Whoa...

448
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:38,880
Holy crap...

449
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:41,560
I never knew he played this well!

450
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:42,360
Right?

451
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:46,880
That's your que.

452
00:31:47,000 --> 00:31:47,520
Go, quick.

453
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:48,840
Go. Hurry.

454
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:49,880
Hurry.

455
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:50,880
Go.

456
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:51,920
Get up.

457
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:52,680
Get up.

458
00:31:52,680 --> 00:31:53,720
Can you even stand up right now?

459
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:54,240
Ouch...

460
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:56,120
Hey, take it easy, man.

461
00:31:58,360 --> 00:31:59,520
Come on.

462
00:32:08,640 --> 00:32:10,280
I'm sorry for everything.

463
00:32:13,280 --> 00:32:14,640
Please make up with me?

464
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:18,280
Can you really drive a car like this?

465
00:33:23,600 --> 00:33:24,480
Of course.

466
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:26,240
Why wouldn't I be able to?

467
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:33,200
I just thought you could only drive expensive cars.

468
00:33:43,680 --> 00:33:45,160
I love you, Jane.

469
00:33:52,760 --> 00:33:55,000
Once everything settles down...

470
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:58,320
I want to go back to drawing comics again.

471
00:34:01,080 --> 00:34:02,920
I'll support you then.

472
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:08,800
Just supporting is enough, okay?

473
00:34:11,159 --> 00:34:13,080
I want to try on my own.

474
00:34:18,800 --> 00:34:19,679
Alright then.

475
00:34:20,120 --> 00:34:21,679
I can just help buy them.

476
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:32,719
P'Jane...

477
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:38,440
Can I ask you something?

478
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:44,920
What is your dream?

479
00:34:47,120 --> 00:34:48,000
If we don't count...

480
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:49,639
favors.

481
00:34:51,199 --> 00:34:51,920
When I was young,

482
00:34:53,080 --> 00:34:54,719
I dreamed of becoming a pianist.

483
00:34:55,360 --> 00:34:56,920
I'm not surprised at all.

484
00:34:57,560 --> 00:34:59,400
You play so well after all.

485
00:35:00,680 --> 00:35:02,800
Just trying to win me back.

486
00:35:04,160 --> 00:35:06,560
Did you really have to go all out like this?

487
00:35:07,760 --> 00:35:08,680
All out?

488
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:11,280
I thought it was pretty ordinary.

489
00:35:15,520 --> 00:35:18,120
Your version of ordinary and mine

490
00:35:19,400 --> 00:35:21,280
probably aren't the same.

491
00:35:22,600 --> 00:35:24,200
Jane, do you remember

492
00:35:25,160 --> 00:35:27,400
when you said you liked me best

493
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:30,640
when I did ordinary things?

494
00:35:32,120 --> 00:35:33,400
I remember.

495
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:36,400
And after that...

496
00:35:36,800 --> 00:35:39,320
you never did anything ordinary again.

497
00:35:59,400 --> 00:36:00,400
I promise you...

498
00:36:02,400 --> 00:36:02,880
from now on,

499
00:36:02,880 --> 00:36:05,120
I'll try to do things more ordinarily.

500
00:36:07,560 --> 00:36:10,520
I'll try to step into your world more too.

501
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:20,480
As if someone like you, P'Jane...

502
00:36:21,680 --> 00:36:23,800
could actually do things ordinarily.

503
00:36:24,760 --> 00:36:26,280
The moment I let my guard down,

504
00:36:27,120 --> 00:36:29,200
you'll definitely sneak off to grant another favor.

505
00:36:39,600 --> 00:36:40,400
Jane...

506
00:36:43,880 --> 00:36:46,000
You are my new dream.

507
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:56,800
Will you marry me?

508
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:14,760
Okay.

509
00:37:57,960 --> 00:38:00,560
In a car, truly ordinary, huh?

510
00:38:05,160 --> 00:38:05,840
So this time,

511
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:07,480
you can accept the house back from me, right?

512
00:38:09,200 --> 00:38:10,680
That has nothing to do with it!

513
00:38:11,560 --> 00:38:13,040
We're getting married now.

514
00:38:14,800 --> 00:38:16,560
I'm giving you the house as a wedding gift.

515
00:39:15,040 --> 00:39:15,880
Jane!

516
00:39:16,680 --> 00:39:18,520
Jane, stay with me!

517
00:39:20,560 --> 00:39:21,480
Jane!

518
00:39:22,160 --> 00:39:22,800
Jane!

519
00:39:23,080 --> 00:39:24,120
Jane!

520
00:39:27,640 --> 00:39:29,040
Don't slip away, Jane!

521
00:39:30,320 --> 00:39:31,000
Jane!

522
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:32,720
Jane!

523
00:39:35,200 --> 00:39:36,280
Jane!

524
00:39:36,640 --> 00:39:38,040
I'm sorry, Jane!

525
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:40,800
Jane!

526
00:39:41,400 --> 00:39:42,400
Jane!

527
00:39:46,080 --> 00:39:47,360
Jane... Jane!

528
00:39:47,600 --> 00:39:48,560
Jane!

529
00:39:49,080 --> 00:39:50,080
P'Ram!

530
00:39:50,840 --> 00:39:52,240
Please save Jane!

531
00:39:52,240 --> 00:39:53,440
Jane, calm down first.

532
00:39:53,440 --> 00:39:54,600
I'll take care of it myself.

533
00:39:54,600 --> 00:39:55,720
Wait right here.

534
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:36,840
P'Big Jane...

535
00:40:38,000 --> 00:40:39,280
How is my brother?

536
00:40:41,520 --> 00:40:42,000
How...

537
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:43,080
how is he?

538
00:40:45,600 --> 00:40:47,000
Big Jane?

539
00:40:47,680 --> 00:40:49,000
How is Jane?

540
00:40:52,360 --> 00:40:53,760
Uncle, Auntie...

541
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:04,600
I'm so sorry.

542
00:41:06,000 --> 00:41:07,440
It's all my fault.

543
00:41:09,640 --> 00:41:11,480
I didn't take good care of Jane.

544
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:21,360
P'Jane, get up.

545
00:41:21,360 --> 00:41:22,880
It's not your fault.

546
00:41:22,880 --> 00:41:24,040
Don't blame yourself.

547
00:41:24,480 --> 00:41:25,360
That's right.

548
00:41:25,360 --> 00:41:26,440
It was an accident.

549
00:41:26,440 --> 00:41:28,160
Nobody wanted this to happen.

550
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:40,080
How is my son, Doctor?

551
00:41:40,720 --> 00:41:42,480
How is our Jane, Doctor?

552
00:41:44,040 --> 00:41:44,840
P'Ram...

553
00:41:49,080 --> 00:41:49,880
Uh...

554
00:41:52,080 --> 00:41:54,080
Jane suffered a severe concussion.

555
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:58,240
He is not out of danger yet.

556
00:42:00,040 --> 00:42:00,680
Either way...

557
00:42:01,640 --> 00:42:03,480
we'll have to monitor his condition closely tonight.

558
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:09,880
Mom!

559
00:42:11,040 --> 00:42:12,480
Go sit over there first.

560
00:42:13,720 --> 00:42:14,640
Jane...

561
00:42:38,040 --> 00:42:38,840
Boss.

562
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:41,800
The police concluded that it was an accident,

563
00:42:41,800 --> 00:42:43,120
the driver fell asleep at the wheel.

564
00:42:47,160 --> 00:42:48,600
And what did your informant say?

565
00:42:49,160 --> 00:42:50,200
It seems that this matter

566
00:42:50,200 --> 00:42:51,800
involves a politician

567
00:42:51,800 --> 00:42:52,960
who lost benefits

568
00:42:52,960 --> 00:42:54,720
from your latest favor.

569
00:42:55,280 --> 00:42:56,960
Regarding the Director-General position?

570
00:43:03,280 --> 00:43:05,080
This definitely wasn't an accident.

571
00:43:07,080 --> 00:43:09,360
Please keep following up on this for me then.

572
00:43:10,480 --> 00:43:12,400
Right now, I have other matters to handle.

573
00:43:13,240 --> 00:43:14,040
Understood.

574
00:43:27,160 --> 00:43:28,280
Hello, Uncle, Auntie.

575
00:43:28,280 --> 00:43:29,600
Oh, hello.

576
00:43:29,600 --> 00:43:31,400
How is Jane doing?

577
00:43:31,400 --> 00:43:33,200
We've been monitoring him since last night.

578
00:43:33,200 --> 00:43:34,000
We're waiting for Doctor Ram to come out

579
